{"reviewId": "253684170_7ZKNl8G8o", "review": {"abstract": "，但到底是什么力量推动了资本主义的长期周期运动，依然没有统一的观点", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "资本主义的诞生有多少年呢？资本主义的生命又会有多少年？我们讨论资本主义取代封建主义，共产主义取代资本主义，都反思事物的本身发展中蕴含着毁灭自身的力量，周期运动是否都有固定的期限呢？如果能总结那么后人一定会改进，这个具体的时间就一定会失效", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "3788-3821", "createTime": 1745857244, "title": "", "type": 1, "reviewId": "253684170_7ZKNl8G8o", "userVid": 253684170, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 6, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 253684170, "name": "叶耀233", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/OxUBpiaYgpHhbjW5kqTzJ7DcjuId37hMsgXFau0icVuOLJcGspYvmYyw/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "凡难事必有所得", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "读万卷书，行万里路，但行好事", "medalInfo": {"id": "M9-0-100", "desc": "阅读神作", "title": "神作发烧友", "levelIndex": 100}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 2, "likes": [{"userVid": 7430284, "name": "smile", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0021-b~OWAmK4l~atHx95rLH92e5/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "smile", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-100", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 100}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "啥时候说共产主义要取代资本主义了？ ", "reviewId": "253684170_7